<title>USA: WMX targets $1.75 EPS in '97, $2.05 in '98.</title>
<headline>WMX targets $1.75 EPS in '97, $2.05 in '98.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>WMX Technologies Inc said Tuesday it was aiming for earnings per share from continuing operations of $1.75 in 1997 and $2.05 in 1998.  </p>
<p>The company said it anticipates flat revenues in 1997, and additional costs ranging from $0.08 to $0.10 per share for its reengineering efforts.</p>
<p>The company today announced a new business strategy in which it will divest $1.5 billion in assets and cut about 3,000 jobs.</p>
</text>
